the place. We ordered a few different small plate/appetizer type things. Fried pickles with Thousand Island dressing that were as expected. We had the blac..."},{"business_id":"Hj_-qd7KyQPRqTWzWgsFag","review_id":"1u2GEy0VYWh9g7YhOv42nQ","date":"2016-03-03T00:28:43","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9320081472396851,"text_excerpt":"Even though I'm not a huge beer drinker or enthusiast, this place is really cool. They will mix different beer to make unique flavor combos. As a bartender, I find that really interesting. As I enjoyed the one beer/cider that I do drink (Gumption by Woodchuck), I thoroughly enjoyed the HUGE pretzel appetizer! OMG, it was to die for! Great atmosphere, great staff, can't wait to return!"},{"business_id":"Hj_-qd7KyQPRqTWzWgsFag","review_id":"2byqz25YsGqZcnqflfcOjA","date":"2016-08-28T22:28:18","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.931393027305603,"text_excerpt":"Enjoyed the pancakes with blueberries. The breakfast menu has several items that seem unique to this warehouse area. The Bottomless Beerunch on Sunday is the way to go. It includes bottomless Bloody Mary's, Mimosas, or Beermosas, along with a breakfast plate for $23. They were using Titos and Zing Zang from what I could see. I noticed they had a big pretzel as well that looked great. Beer selection is extensive. My bartender took good care o"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Hj_-qd7KyQPRqTWzWgsFag","photo_id":"sNzJdnbvza0kggY_a07AQg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/sNzJdnbvza0kggY_a07AQg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.887859582901001},{"business_id":"Hj_-qd7KyQPRqTWzWgsFag","photo_id":"4ChV8J3uv6Q4QdOwh0WaUg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/4ChV8J3uv6Q4QdOwh0WaUg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8753218054771423},{"business_id":"Hj_-qd7KyQPRqTWzWgsFag","photo_id":"aUcWXTn8rRSIXEg2EatWog","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/aUcWXTn8rRSIXEg2EatWog.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8411318063735962},{"business_id":"Hj_-qd7KyQPRqTWzWgsFag","photo_id":"SxYp0U8NBi_m5xCJR